<title>DENMARK: FORECAST - Danish FLS 96 profits up 30 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Danish FLS 96 profits up 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven analysts polled by Reuters in a forecast issued on Friday foresaw a pre-tax and extraordinary items profit for Danish cement and engineering group FLS Industries for 1996 of an average 735 million crowns, almost 30 percent up on 1995.</p>
<p>When it released 327 million crown first-half 1996 pre-tax profit last August, FLS said it expected ongoing progress in the second half of the year.</p>
<p>FLS is due to announce its 1996 results next week.</p>
<p>FLS INDUSTRIES 1996 RESULT FORECASTS (MILLIONS CROWNS)</p>
<p>		     low/high	   average   1995     change Net</p>
<p>turnover     19,398/20,076	  19,753   18,024    +9.6 pct</p>
<p>Pre-tax/extra</p>
<p> items profit    697/772		 735     566    +29.8 pct</p>
<p>--Joern Nurkka, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969</p>
